son of: Shemaiah (H8098B);
brother of: Hattush (H2407), Igal (H3008I), Neariah (H5294) and Shaphat (H8202I)
§ Bariah = "fleeing" or "fugitive"
son of Shemaiah and descendant of the royal family of Judah
